                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <div class="d-flex gap-4 border-bottom pt-4 pb-3">
                                        <p class="m-0">02</p>
                                        <div>
                                            <h5>Disconnected Information</h5>
                                            <p>Important records are difficult to access.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <div class="d-flex gap-4 border-bottom pt-4 pb-3">
