<div class="bg-dark">
    <div class="container py-5 text-center text-light">
        <p class="mt-5 mb-2 lead" style="letter-spacing: 2px;">The Solution</p>
        <h2 class="m-0 display-2 heading">A complete digital ecosystem for campus estates</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 mb-5 lead text-secondary">From registration to payments and service management, Kovsie Living creates a single connected experience.</p>
    </div>
</div>

