                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md">
                <div>
                    <p class="text-muted lead mb-2">01 / Accommodation</p>
                    <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold mb-2">A complete view of your living space</h2>
                    <p class="text-secondary lead m-0">Residents can manage their accommodation information, account details and estate profile from one secure location.</p>
                    <ul class="navbar-nav gap-2 mt-3">
                        <li class="lead text-muted"><i class="fas fa-check me-2"></i>Residence information</li>
