<div class="py-5" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="m-0 display-6 heading">Frequently asked questions</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 mb-5 lead text-secondary">
                From registration to payments and account management, Kovsie Living creates a single connected experience.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="justify-content-center">
            <div>

                <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">

                    <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
                            <button class="accordion-button fw-semibold"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseOne"
                                    aria-expanded="true"
                                    aria-controls="collapseOne">
                                Who can use Kovsie Living?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="collapseOne"
                             class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                             aria-labelledby="headingOne"
                             data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                                Kovsie Living is designed for University of the Free State QwaQwa Campus students and staff members who use the university estate's accommodation and related services.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseTwo"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                                How do I create an account?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="collapseTwo"
                             class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                             aria-labelledby="headingTwo"
                             data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                                Students and staff members can register by providing their required personal information. Students provide details such as their name, surname and student number, while staff members provide their name, surname and personal or employee number.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseThree"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="collapseThree">
                                What payments can I make through Kovsie Living?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="collapseThree"
                             class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                             aria-labelledby="headingThree"
                             data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                                Kovsie Living allows users to manage payments for services such as rent, water usage, electricity, parking fees for additional vehicles, and refuse collection.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseFour"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="collapseFour">
                                What are the different user roles?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="collapseFour"
                             class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                             aria-labelledby="headingFour"
                             data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                                Kovsie Living has three user roles: <strong>Administrators</strong> manage the system and authorize financial officers, <strong>Financial Officers</strong> manage customer accounts and process payments, and <strong>Customers</strong> (students and staff) can register, make payments and view their account status.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseFive"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-controls="collapseFive">
                                Can I use Kovsie Living on my phone?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="collapseFive"
                             class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                             aria-labelledby="headingFive"
                             data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                                Yes! Kovsie Living includes both a web application and an Android mobile application. Both applications communicate with the same system, so you can access your account and make payments from any device, anywhere.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="py-5" id="contact">
    <div class="container py-lg-4">

        <div class="row justify-content-center text-center mb-5">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h6 class="text-uppercase text-muted fw-bold mb-2" style="letter-spacing: 2px;">Get in touch</h6>
                <h2 class="display-6 heading mb-3">How can we help?</h2>
                <p class="text-secondary">
                    Whether you have a question about payments, need help with your account, or want to report an issue with the estate, we're here to assist.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-10">
                <div class="row bg-white g-0 border rounded-4 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">

                    <!-- LEFT: Owner / Contact Details -->
                    <div class="col-md-4 bg-light p-4 p-lg-5 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="mb-4">
                                <div class="bg-dark text-white rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3" style="width: 48px; height: 48px;">
                                    <i class="fas fa-user-tie fs-5"></i>
                                </div>
                                <h5 class="heading mb-1">LeeYoo Khumalo</h5>
                                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Project Owner</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3 mt-5">
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                    <i class="fas fa-id-badge text-muted"></i>
                                    <span class="text-dark small fw-medium">2021846196</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                    <i class="fas fa-phone text-muted"></i>
                                    <a href="tel:+27655251871" class="text-dark small fw-medium text-decoration-none">065 525 1871</a>
                                </div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                    <i class="fas fa-envelope text-muted"></i>
                                    <a href="mailto:2021846196@ufs4life.ac.za" class="text-dark small fw-medium text-decoration-none text-break">2021846196@ufs4life.ac.za</a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-top border-2 border-white">
                            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                                <i class="fas fa-location-dot me-2"></i>UFS QwaQwa Campus
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- RIGHT: Form -->
                    <div class="col-md-8 bg-white p-4 p-lg-5">
                        <form asp-action="Submit" asp-controller="Contact" method="post">
                            @Html.AntiForgeryToken()

                            <div class="row g-4">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <label for="contactFullName" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-muted">Full Name</label>
                                    <input id="contactFullName" name="FullName" type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="LeeYoo Khumalo" required maxlength="100" />
                                </div>

                                <!-- FIXED: Added the missing div and label here -->
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <label for="contactEmail" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-muted">Email Address</label>
                                    <input id="contactEmail" name="Email" type="email" class="form-control"
                                           placeholder="2021846196@ufs4life.ac.za"
                                           value="@(User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated == true ? $"{User.Identity.Name}@ufs4life.ac.za" : "")"
                                           required maxlength="100"
                                           pattern="^[0-9]+@@ufs4life\.ac\.za$"
                                           title="Please use your official UFS email address" />
                                </div>

                                <div class="col-12">
                                    <label for="contactSubject" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-muted">Subject</label>
                                    <input id="contactSubject" name="Subject" type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. Issue with payment" required maxlength="150" />
                                </div>

                                <div class="col-12">
                                    <label for="contactMessage" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-muted">Message</label>
                                    <textarea id="contactMessage" name="Message" rows="4" class="form-control" placeholder="Tell us how we can help..." required minlength="10" maxlength="2000"></textarea>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-3">
                                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                                    <i class="fas fa-shield-halved me-1"></i> Your information is kept private.
                                </p>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-dark-soft px-4 py-2">
                                    Send Message <i class="fas fa-paper-plane ms-1"></i>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>